        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Psi. Abra usa seus poderes psíquicos enquanto dorme, e o conteúdo de seus sonhos influencia as habilidades que manifesta. Ele também consegue se teleportar durante o sono. Ao que tudo indica, quanto mais profundamente dorme, mais longe vai.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Abra pode evoluir para Kadabra no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Scratch, Teleport</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dream Eater, Embargo, Energy Ball, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gravity, Guard Swap, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Speed Swap, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Taunt, Telekinesis, Thief, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Tri Attack, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ally Switch, Barrier, Confusion, Encore, Fire Punch, Guard Split, Guard Swap, Ice Punch, Knock Off, Magic Coat, Power Trick, Psychic Terrain, Psycho Shift, Skill Swap, Thunder Punch</p>",
